# Developer-facing scratch demos (rendered output, not the .qmd sources)
inst/demo/*.html

node_modules/

issues/

# scripts/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Three workflows execute files from it
# — deploy.yml, structure-check.yml and interday-audit.yml — so a script that
# fails to get committed breaks CI after the merge, not before it. The blanket
# `/scripts/` ignore here was a leftover from f7ff8ca, when the directory held
# local scratch helpers; by #533 every file in it was tracked and nothing was
# actually being ignored, leaving only a trap for the next file added. Note
# that re-including with `!/scripts/*.sh` does not work: git never descends
# into an excluded directory, so the exclusion has to go entirely.
**/*.quarto_ipynb

docs/context/analysis/

# Stitched deviations log: previously a committed build artifact, now
# rendered inline into changes-from-source.qmd at site-build time. Keep
# the path ignored so a stray local build of an old script can't sneak
# the file back into git.
docs/deviations-from-source.md

venv/
temp/

.claude/*.lock

# Claude Code agent worktrees (harness-managed, never commit)
.claude/worktrees/
